{"id":"n85009-1-7","stage":4,"title":"해발 · 海拔","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n85009-1-7-1","ko":"이번에 회사 등산 동호회에서 가는 산은 높이가 얼마나 된대요?","zh":"这次公司登山俱乐部要去的那座山，高度大概有多少呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번에","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번에","audio":"/audio/46d83053c21d45a8f49f.mp3"}},{"text":"회사","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社。","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}},{"text":"등산","meaning":"登山","explanation":"등산：登山。","readings":[{"term":"등산","audio":"/audio/ae5010e03333d4ba63ff.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40293","senseId":"2","lemma":"등산","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"등산","audio":"/audio/ae5010e03333d4ba63ff.mp3"}},{"text":"동호회에서","meaning":"爱好者协会，兴趣组，俱乐部","explanation":"동호회：爱好者协会，兴趣组，俱乐部；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"동호회","audio":"/audio/6a07fcf5dab07a8e9402.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48159","senseId":"1","lemma":"동호회","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동호회에서","audio":"/audio/40d043f7c5960f7945da.mp3"}},{"text":"가는","meaning":"通往，通向","explanation":"가다：通往，通向；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"16","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가는","audio":"/audio/4df15b29e7ed7afe1cce.mp3"}},{"text":"산은","meaning":"山","explanation":"산：山；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"산","audio":"/audio/ab367eb9a60ab986cced.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20954"